{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50750","headline":"送郑灊判官归冬宁 · 张祜","name":"送郑灊判官归冬宁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结束翩翩肯寡悰，早时强学已三冬。\n鲤庭趍日通明训，郑曲归时美盛宗。\n摘句竞推梁记室，谈经今绍汉司农。\n异闻不暇陈亢问，尔德无非是孝恭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}